  "label": "User projected onto the textual material addressing them",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'hm.. it appears you're' and 'a cracker' because the text directly addresses the viewer with 'you're', indicating the user is the target of the insult. The projection is onto the textual material which contains the deictic pronoun 'you', making the user the subject of the slur. The visual material (gourmet_dish) serves as a contextual anchor for the slur, but the direct projection is onto the text that addresses the user.",
